            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பாட்டி எங்களுக்கு ஒரு விடுகதை சொன்னாள். pāṭṭi eṅkaḷukku oru viṭukatai coṉṉāḷ. Grandmother told us a riddle."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A spoken riddle, given as a little story; the listener must find the answer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "விடுகதை (viṭukatai) ends in கதை (katai), \"a story\", from Sanskrit kathā (CDIAL 2704); how the first part, விடு, joins it is not settled."
