              "text": "விடுமுறையில் நாங்கள் தாயம் விளையாடினோம். viṭumuṟaiyil nāṅkaḷ tāyam viḷaiyāṭiṉōm. In the holidays we played the dice game."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A board game played with dice; the game takes விளையாடு (viḷaiyāṭu) like any other."
